{
  "name": "Daily new jobs from Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby and Workday boards to a CSV file",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### How it works\nFor job seekers, recruiters and researchers who track hiring at specific companies. Every morning at 8 the workflow asks the Apify Actor fecklesspleb/ats-jobs-scraper for jobs on the career boards you list (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, Workday, Workable, Recruitee, Teamtailor). Monitoring mode (onlyNewJobs) returns only jobs it has not returned before. A filter drops the Actor's free status records, **Skip jobs already saved** drops any Job ID this workflow has written before, and the new jobs are saved as a CSV file named `new_jobs_YYYY-MM-DD_HHmmss.csv`. The file needs no credential. A run with no new jobs writes no file.\n\n### Setup\n1. Copy your Apify API token from Apify Console > Settings > API & Integrations. In n8n create a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer ` followed by your token. Select it in **Run ATS Jobs Scraper**.\n2. In **Search settings**, set `companies` (board URLs or `ats:slug`), `keywords` (title words), `maxUsd` (spending cap per run) and `outputFolder`. n8n 2.x writes files only inside allowed folders: `/home/node/.n8n-files` is the default in the official Docker image; elsewhere use a folder listed in `N8N_RESTRICT_FILE_ACCESS_TO`.\n3. Click **Execute workflow**, open the CSV, then activate.\n\nDisclosure: fecklesspleb built this template and the paid Actor it calls ($0.002 per job returned). `maxUsd` is sent as `maxTotalChargeUsd`, which stops the run at your cap. Runs longer than 300 seconds return HTTP 408 to n8n while continuing on Apify, so keep each workflow to a few dozen boards. Built on n8n 2.45.4.\n\n### Customization\nYou can replace the two file nodes with Google Sheets, a database or a webhook node; only the CSV output is tested. Use a different `stateStoreName` for each separate search.",
        "height": 860,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "7c1db829-d7c3-5af5-bd3c-791d696b1102",
      "name": "Main note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule and settings\nChange the run time, boards, keywords and spending cap here.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "25515c8e-4c98-5d31-9590-b9202520b108",
      "name": "Section: settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fetch new jobs from Apify\nOne API call per run. maxTotalChargeUsd stops spending at your cap.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d8c3298a-63db-54d0-b9e1-95366f0904ff",
      "name": "Section: scrape",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Keep only new jobs\nDrops status records, then any Job ID this workflow saved in an earlier run.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 680,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "872e6df3-dfef-5b27-81c4-054c85e3e458",
      "name": "Section: new",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Save as CSV\nOne dated file per run with new jobs. No credential needed.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "bd200825-e705-5130-b018-40471e262a41",
      "name": "Section: csv",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1600,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "0337dd09-c88d-560a-8a54-3f5d1ab71752",
      "name": "Every morning at 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b8d147a6-552d-59b9-ab19-9ef67b1ef6af",
              "name": "companies",
              "value": "[\"https://boards.greenhouse.io/airbnb\", \"https://jobs.lever.co/spotify\", \"ashby:ramp\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "775f65e0-3226-56a7-b4fb-e0efe766fcbd",
              "name": "keywords",
              "value": "[\"engineer\", \"developer\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "788c3761-5975-5693-98dd-09afe1088c97",
              "name": "stateStoreName",
              "value": "n8n-new-jobs",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "201b4dba-0dde-5668-b866-bb2d4fddc747",
              "name": "maxUsd",
              "value": "0.5",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "e90feb09-17a6-5bbd-b7ac-f7796869bbfa",
              "name": "outputFolder",
              "value": "/home/node/.n8n-files",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4e2a1f3b-c309-5aa8-9c4c-a09d79cf9eed",
      "name": "Search settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        200,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/fecklesspleb~ats-jobs-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "={{ $json.maxUsd }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "timeout",
              "value": "280"
            },
            {
              "name": "clean",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ companies: $json.companies, keywords: $json.keywords, onlyNewJobs: true, stateStoreName: $json.stateStoreName, includeDescription: false, maxTotalJobs: 500 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 320000
        }
      },
      "id": "469373e4-8e98-586f-87a0-56405527fb3f",
      "name": "Run ATS Jobs Scraper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a71f7813-8263-52b6-a841-c92ae88f7d0d",
              "leftValue": "={{ !$json.type && ($json.status === undefined || $json.status === null || $json.status === 'active') && !!$json.uid && !!$json.url }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e4c56eed-72e0-5109-a84c-bee943438151",
      "name": "Keep job records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "885c3d8c-bf98-5d05-b88b-67142aa9d240",
              "name": "Job ID",
              "value": "={{ $json.uid }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "88c0c85a-2631-5532-a2f7-79ab95f602f1",
              "name": "Company",
              "value": "={{ $json.companyName || $json.companySlug }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f11c36f0-5754-5578-91b4-3b9730e429d7",
              "name": "Title",
              "value": "={{ $json.title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "10729068-c9ee-5efb-bd1e-4d3cd84fc6eb",
              "name": "Location",
              "value": "={{ ($json.locations || [$json.location]).filter(Boolean).join('; ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "dffc6977-b205-55be-8b6c-806aabad1ddd",
              "name": "Work arrangement",
              "value": "={{ $json.workArrangement || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "10c9d288-7f8b-58c0-96e2-105b864cf8f4",
              "name": "Posted",
              "value": "={{ $json.postedAt ? String($json.postedAt).slice(0, 10) : '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f34285c0-8b61-511d-a193-8dfc77c33307",
              "name": "Salary",
              "value": "={{ $json.salaryText || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4d6eb44c-e08f-54d4-b4f9-de7acbbc7b11",
              "name": "URL",
              "value": "={{ $json.url }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b141efae-b6e2-5aa4-9ec1-addbed3c336e",
              "name": "ATS",
              "value": "={{ $json.ats }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b74a95fd-ebed-525b-9def-a6e412b34b69",
              "name": "First seen",
              "value": "={{ $json.firstSeenAt ? String($json.firstSeenAt).slice(0, 10) : $now.toISODate() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "05460a91-53b3-565d-9793-f951e3a7c68b",
      "name": "Shape job row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1180,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json['Job ID'] }}",
        "options": {
          "scope": "workflow",
          "historySize": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "30e133b6-a667-59b0-b0c9-15877895a823",
      "name": "Skip jobs already saved",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1400,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "csv",
        "options": {
          "headerRow": true
        }
      },
      "id": "2452693b-e645-5a85-8ce7-deeac4c3107a",
      "name": "Convert to CSV",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1700,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "write",
        "fileName": "={{ $('Search settings').first().json.outputFolder.replace(/\\/$/, '') }}/new_jobs_{{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd_HHmmss') }}.csv",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "92f34423-08e7-5224-8c90-255e70740db1",
      "name": "Write CSV file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
